       <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T7">Possible retail partner: Pura Vida, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T8">Costa Mesa, </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://moringapowder.com/pages/about-us" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link">(Web-About)</text:a></text:p>
       <text:list>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P43"><text:span text:style-name="T41">R</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T37">etails Philippines-sourced powder, capsules, and oil (2 or 4 oz)</text:span></text:p>
